    "content": "<p>Enjoy boosted battles and grab extra League Points during the Leagues Boost Event until May 23<strong>!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><strong>May 15&ndash;23</strong>: Earn 50% more League Points for victory and lose fewer points in defeat&mdash;your chance to climb faster, higher, further.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"important-text important-text--icon important-text--color_special\">\r\n<div class=\"important-text__inner\">\r\n<div class=\"important-text__icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"important-text__text\">\r\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT</strong>: Bronze Pilots cannot participate in this event, so fight to reach Silver or higher to join in!&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>Get ready to go into overdrive with the <strong>Leagues Boost Event</strong> until May 23!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S&trade;</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One&trade;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and joi